<title>UK: Banco America do Sul sets $55 mln bond.</title>
<headline>Banco America do Sul sets $55 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Lyonnais.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO AMERICA DO SUL SA</p>
<p> AMT    $55 MLN	 COUPON     9.25	MATURITY    03.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.923    PAY DATE    03.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  75 BP     REOFFER    99.923    SPREAD	+350 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    25 BP     SELL CONC  50 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND THREE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
